<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines offers 38-day special series T-bills.</title>
<headline>Philippines offers 38-day special series T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Monday it is offering 38-day special series Treasury bills with a coupon of 10.5 percent through its over-the-counter facility.</p>
<p>The bank withdrew its 131-day special series T-bills from the facility, while it maintained its 86-day series special T-bills at 10.6 percent.</p>
<p>It kept the interest rates on its overnight and termed reverse repos unchanged.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
